The  driver  provides  a  line  discipline  to  send  and receive
BlueCore Serial Protocol packets over a serial line, as described
in the specification.  Moreover, the supports  BCSP  Link  Estab‐
lishment  Protocol,  as described in the specification.  The pro‐
gram is used to configure the tty line and create the driver  in‐
stance.   The  device  appeared in does not support configuration
for baud rate yet.
